      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. so if the UN is mostly just a tool for the big powers to play games with, wouldn't you say that global governance is basically just an illusion that people use to ignore the reality of national interest? like, is there actually any legitimate point to it, or is it just a waste of resources at this point?",
